{
  "version": "esper-parity/v1",
  "id": "resultset-aggregate-minmax-groupby",
  "description": "ResultSetAggregateMaxMinGroupBy executions ResultSetAggregateMinMax (ordinal 0) and ResultSetAggregateMinNoGroupHaving (ordinal 4): grouped irstream min/max all and distinct volume over a filtered length(3) market window, followed by ungrouped new-only volume HAVING over a time(5 sec) window. No virtual time is advanced; payloads preserve the pinned SupportMarketDataBean symbol, volume (including null), and price=0 sequence.",
  "javaCommit": "9e1b9f1cc9117fea4bf33ab043762c045d73839c",
  "javaSource": "regression-lib/src/main/java/com/espertech/esper/regressionlib/suite/resultset/aggregate/ResultSetAggregateMaxMinGroupBy.java",
  "javaRuntimes": [
    "java-runtime-6ee286d6f857ddbbd091",
